                                                "sense_id": "368f03f1-cfb8-3653-9597-1b04d6763389",
                                                "text": "Now no chaſtening for the preſent ſeemeth to be ioyous, but grieuous: neuertheleſſe, afterward it yeeldeth the peaceable fruite of righteouſneſſe, vnto them which are exerciſed thereby."
