                                                "sense_id": "368f03f1-cfb8-3653-9597-1b04d6763389",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless, it is clear that the global energy demand for air-conditioning will grow substantially as nations become more affluent, with the consequences of climate change potentially accelerating the demand."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd8ee2d6-8d9e-465c-b97d-82c0e59d7151",
                                                "sense_id": "368f03f1-cfb8-3653-9597-1b04d6763389",
                                                "text": "Paul did eventually mention potential First Amendment concerns, saying, \"We have to be wary of where it leads to, so it doesn't lead to speech problems.\" He nevertheless could and should have made it clearer that the \"crackdown\" he has in mind does not entail the sort of government restrictions that Carr and Cruz rightly rejected."
                                            }
